<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan foreign exchange market closes for holiday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan foreign exchange market closes for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's foreign exchange market is closed on Tuesday for a domestic public holiday.</p>
<p>On Monday, the local dollar ended at T$27.495 against one U.S. dollar. Turnover was US$120.5 million.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
